# Internal zone goes straight to Technitium's ClusterIP, not via the tailnet.
# Technitium is only published to the tailnet through a Tailscale
# LoadBalancer, which needs the operator + proxy pods, which need DNS to pull
# their images. Routing famcr.org through 100.100.100.100 closed that loop and
# took the cluster down for 12 days in Oct 2026. CoreDNS can't forward to a
# name, so this is the ClusterIP of technitium/technitium-technitium-dns-dns -
# update it if that Service is ever recreated.
famcr.org {
    errors
    cache 30
    forward . 10.43.12.228
}
# MagicDNS names are answered by tailscaled itself, no Technitium involved.
ts.net:53 {
    errors
    cache 30
    forward . 100.100.100.100
}
